.vs/
*.user

# VS project-upgrade log (emitted when opening the solution)
UpgradeLog*.htm
UpgradeLog*/

# WinUI / MSIX generated output
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.msix
